{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07681","headline":"书怀贻京邑同好 · 孟浩然","name":"书怀贻京邑同好","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"维先自邹鲁，家世重儒风。\n诗体袭遗训，趋庭沾末躬。\n昼夜常自强，词翰颇亦工。\n三十既成立，嗟吁命不通。\n慈亲向羸老，喜惧在深衷。\n甘脆朝不足，箪瓢夕屡空。\n执鞭慕夫子，捧檄怀毛公。\n感激遂弹冠，安能守固穷。\n当途诉知己，投剌匪求蒙。\n秦楚邈离异，飜飞何日同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}